[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; The plaza's benches and bins, placed by hand. Editor-owned: move, turn, add or
; remove them here in the Godot editor. Keep each one a direct child of this
; node: `tools/clearance_test.gd` measures a placement by its top-level name.
;
; Benches are instances of `park_furniture/plaza_bench.tscn`, whose seat markers
; tell the crowd where to sit, so `tools/gen_crowd.gd` reads this scene and
; seated guests follow any change after the crowd is regenerated.
; `tools/gen_props.gd` reads the `bench_hut` placement for the balloons tied to
; its back rail. Moved out of the generator on 2026-09-24 at the positions it
; last emitted.
;
; Bins are instances of `park_furniture/waste_bin.tscn`. `bin_0` to `bin_9` are
; the ring and room bins, which `tools/gen_props.gd` reads so the trees and the
; outer lamps it scatters keep clear of them (bins added under other names are
; not avoided); `bin_o0` to `bin_o7` were scattered in the outer room. The crowd
; walks past bins rather than round them, so moving one needs no crowd
; regeneration. Moved out of the generator on 2026-09-27 at the positions it
; last emitted, 5 mm higher: its cylinder was sunk 5 mm into the floor.

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://scenes/world/park_furniture/plaza_bench.tscn" id="1_bench"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://scenes/world/park_furniture/waste_bin.tscn" id="2_bin"]

